          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#111214;--muted:#bfc6c2;--accent:#c7a87a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial; color:#eef0ec;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#060606 0%, #0f0f10 60%);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:36px}\\n    .intro{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:36px;border-radius:12px}\\n    h1{color:#fff;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.4px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px 0}\\n    .avatar{width:100%;height:340px;background:var(--glass);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .section{background:var(--card);margin-bottom:20px;padding:22px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(199,168,122,0.12);color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;background:var(--accent);color:#081216;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){header.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}} \\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Specialties</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"intro\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Guided Practice</span>\\n        <h1>Grounded therapy for meaningful change</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I’m {{THERAPIST_NAME}} ({{LICENSE}}). In my private practice I offer attuned, confidentiality-first psychotherapy to people navigating anxiety, relationships, grief, and transitions. Therapy here is a thoughtful, spiritual-minded companioning — practical and reflective.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Sessions offered in-person &amp; telehealth</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n        <!-- local SVG placeholder -->\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Avatar illustration\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:#fff\\\">A thoughtful intake — the Diagnostic Conversation</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">We begin with a 50-minute Diagnostic Conversation — a calm review of your history, current stressors, and hopes. This intake prioritizes safety, confidentiality, and clarity. It’s collaborative: together we map what feels most important right now.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">What to expect</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px\\\">\\n            <li>Exploration of presenting concerns and patterns</li>\\n            <li>Assessment of immediate safety and supports</li>\\n            <li>Initial ideas for pacing and focus</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Practical details</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0\\\">50 minutes • Confidential • Virtual or in-person</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">The Living Plan — Our first map</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">After the Diagnostic Conversation I offer a living plan — a simple, measurable outline we revisit and revise. Think of it as a map: not fixed, but a guide for the next 8–12 weeks. It contains goals, session rhythm, and suggested micro-practices.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">8–12 week scaffold</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(199,168,122,0.07);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--accent)\\\">Flexible pacing</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Shared goals</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Micro-habits to anchor each week</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">Short, consistent practices are how change becomes sustainable. These are small, tailored habits we can try between sessions.</p>\\n      <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <li>3-minute grounding pause each morning</li>\\n        <li>One reflective journal entry, twice weekly</li>\\n        <li>Boundary check — a brief weekly relationship inventory</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Investment &amp; gentle pricing</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">My practice offers a tiered approach so we can match intensity with need.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Clarity Session</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Single 50-minute Diagnostic Conversation — a standalone choice for people wanting an expert consultation and clear next steps.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">The Companion Path</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Ongoing weekly or bi-weekly sessions with collaborative treatment planning. Sliding scale available in select circumstances.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule Your Diagnostic Conversation</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Care, boundaries &amp; safety</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\">All work is confidential within the limits of the law. If you are in crisis or at immediate risk, please call emergency services or your local crisis line. Telehealth carries its own considerations; we will review privacy and limits before sessions.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Scope: I provide psychotherapy for adults. I do not provide emergency psychiatric care or prescribe medication. If appropriate, I will coordinate with other professionals with your consent.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px\\\">Confidentiality &amp; privacy note: Sessions are confidential except where disclosure is required by law.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--card:#f6f5f3;--ink:#222;--muted:#6b6f6d;--accent:#6a8156;--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfa,#fff);color:var(--ink)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero{padding:26px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #fbfbfa)}\\n    h1{font-size:30px;margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:14px}\\n    .spec-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}\\n    .spec{background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .spec h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}\\n    .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    @media(max-width:920px){.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.spec-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Studio</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Methods</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"gallery\\\">\\n      <aside style=\\\"padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fafaf8)\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"decorative pattern\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">A calm, gallery-like collection of clinical focuses — each treated with clinical rigor and spiritual awareness.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      <main>\\n        <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n          <h1>Areas of focus</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"sub\\\">I work with adults seeking a reflective, embodied approach to change. Below are common themes clients bring.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Specialty Portraits</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Each focus includes a short diagnostic lens, suggested plan, and micro-habits to begin between sessions.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"spec-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <h3>Anxiety &amp; Worry</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"note\\\">Diagnostic lens: recent escalation, avoidance patterns, physiological amplification. Plan: paced exposure, regulation skills, values-focused work. Micro-habit: 3-minute grounding practice after waking.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <h3>Trauma &amp; Early Attachment</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"note\\\">Diagnostic lens: relational patterns, triggers linked to attachment history. Plan: safety-building, sensorimotor techniques, relational re-patterning. Micro-habit: boundary notice — a brief daily check-in about needs.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <h3>Relationship Patterns</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"note\\\">Diagnostic lens: repeating cycles, communication blocks, role confusion. Plan: skills-based work, relational experiments, guided reflections. Micro-habit: two weekly sentences reflecting a felt interaction.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <h3>Burnout &amp; Life Transitions</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"note\\\">Diagnostic lens: sustained stress, identity shifts, values drift. Plan: pacing, reprioritization, somatic regulation. Micro-habit: a 10-minute boundary ritual at day’s end.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Programs &amp; pricing (Path framing)</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">I frame ongoing work as Paths — a container for rhythm and intention. Below are common options; we personalize in the Diagnostic Conversation.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;min-width:170px\\\">\\n              <strong>Short Path</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"note\\\">6–8 sessions; focused targets</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;min-width:170px\\\">\\n              <strong>Deep Path</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"note\\\">12–24 sessions; relational/trauma-focused work</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Confidentiality &amp; scope</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Therapy respects privacy and legal limits to confidentiality. If you are in crisis, please call emergency services or a crisis line immediately. I do not provide emergency psychiatric care.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n      <div>Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071018;--card:#0b1b25;--muted:#cbd6d4;--accent:#9fbfba;--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#041016,#071018);color:var(--muted)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .hero .left{flex:1}\\n    h1{color:#fff;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}\\n    .tag{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    .visual{width:280px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(159,191,186,0.06),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .section{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px}\\n    .steps{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .step{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .micro{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#042424;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{flex-direction:column}.steps{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Sessions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"left\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Embodied Strategy</div>\\n        <h1>How I work — a frame for steady, kind progress</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"micro\\\">My approach blends somatic awareness, relational attunement, and reflective inquiry. I aim for clarity: compassionate assessment, collaborative planning, and daily micro-practices that feel doable.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Connect for a Diagnostic Conversation</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"visual\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Hero illustration\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Diagnostic intake — Listening as first practice</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"micro\\\">We begin with a 50-minute Diagnostic intake focused on safety, context, and the stories you're rotating through. I prioritize concrete details and felt experience: how symptoms appear in your life, what supports exist, and what feels most urgent.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">A three-part plan</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"steps\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>1. Stabilize</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Build safety, basic regulation skills, and immediate supports.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>2. Explore</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Trace patterns, relational themes, and core narratives with gentle curiosity.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>3. Integrate</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Create lasting practices and name sustainable next steps.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Micro-habits — small practices, steady results</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"micro\\\">The practices I recommend are brief and repetitive; they cultivate capacity without overwhelming. Examples below can be adapted to your daily life.</p>\\n      <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <li>Two-minute breath check at transitions</li>\\n        <li>Single-sentence journaling about one felt moment per day</li>\\n        <li>Short boundary experiments — one small ask each week</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Fees — Program names & framing</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"micro\\\">I offer three core containers; we choose one during our Diagnostic Conversation depending on need and pace. Sliding scale spots may be available.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:160px\\\">\\n          <strong>Anchor Program</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Steady weekly work for foundational change</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:160px\\\">\\n          <strong>Compass Program</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Short-term targeted work; 6–10 sessions</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;min-width:160px\\\">\\n          <strong>Horizon Consult</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">Single-session consult with focused recommendations</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Boundaries &amp; clinical limits</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"micro\\\">Confidentiality is maintained within the limits of law. If you are in crisis, call emergency services or a crisis line immediately. I do not provide emergency psychiatric services or prescribe medications; when needed, I coordinate care with other providers with your consent.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\\\">Questions? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
